DON'T WORK SO MUCH.

00:08:19.695 --> 00:08:21.062
&gt;&gt; Juan: THAT'S NOT SO HARD.

00:08:21.063 --> 00:08:23.465
HE'S TAKEN A 16 DAY CHRISTMAS

00:08:23.466 --> 00:08:23.798
HOLIDAY.

00:08:23.799 --> 00:08:24.866
&gt;&gt; Greg: GOOD FOR HIM.

00:08:24.867 --> 00:08:26.901
HE DOES FIVE THINGS IN THE DAY

00:08:26.902 --> 00:08:27.569
WHEN PRESIDENTS USUALLY GET

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.370
AROUND TO ONE.

00:08:29.371 --> 00:08:30.371
IMPEACH HIM.

00:08:30.372 --> 00:08:32.674
WHAT DO YOU GET?

00:08:32.675 --> 00:08:33.508
YOU GET PENCE.

00:08:33.509 --> 00:08:35.043
PENCE IS SO CONSERVATIVE, HE

00:08:35.044 --> 00:08:39.113
ONCE PAID OFF A WOMAN AFTER HE

00:08:39.114 --> 00:08:39.914
SHOOK HER HAND.

00:08:39.915 --> 00:08:41.516
YOU TRADE IN MR. RIGHT, YOU'RE

00:08:41.517 --> 00:08:43.318
GOING TO GET MR. EVEN MORE

00:08:43.319 --> 00:08:43.918
RIGHT.

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:46.121
THIS IS SUCH A TRAVESTY.

